   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=0\\\\z=0\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+y=1\\\\x-y=1\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y es paralelo a \\(s\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y es perpendicular a \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Datos",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) es el eje \\(Y\\): punto \\(O(0,0,0)\\) y dirección \\(\\vec d_r=(0,1,0)\\). Para \\(s\\): sumando las ecuaciones, \\(x=1\\); restando, \\(y=0\\): \\(s\\equiv(1,0,t)\\), con punto \\(S(1,0,0)\\) y dirección \\(\\vec d_s=(0,0,1)\\).</p></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(r\\) (por \\(O\\), con dirección \\(\\vec d_r\\)) y es paralelo a \\(s\\) (con dirección \\(\\vec d_s\\)): su normal es perpendicular a ambas<i class='n' data-t='th'>Un plano paralelo a una recta contiene la dirección de la recta; su normal es perpendicular a ella.</i>:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d_r\\times\\vec d_s=(0,1,0)\\times(0,0,1)=(1,0,0)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x=0\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":35,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[0.0,2.6,2.1],[0.0,-2.6,2.1],[0.0,-2.6,-0.6],[0.0,2.6,-0.6]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.0,-2.6,-0.6],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.0,-2.4,0.0],[0.0,2.4,0.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,2.4,0.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1.0,0.0,-1.8],[1.0,0.0,1.8],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,0.0,1.8],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1,0,0.4],[1.0,0.0,1.4],\"#16a34a\",\"d_s\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0,1,0.5],[1.2,1.0,0.5],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[1,0,0],\"S\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n527n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n527d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n527g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n527r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='242.7,74.8 26.0,18.0 26.0,145.4 242.7,202.2' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y